{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1348.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"51e7dd6ff2e2840bfffcc133afcdadb39ef962c936fd157b309ce066bf53b6dd","ja":"今年もよろしくお願いします","zh":"今年也请多多关照","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1348.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"040f9c44d1324d5eac4dc18fb55929ccbd4032ef782e0bc3eb04015caa3c1985","ja":"真、新年のステージは、\n普段と違った趣がありますね……。","zh":"真，新年的舞台，\n有着与平时不同的风趣呢……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1348.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"4abd684de53f3fd9c7d7d7d693ca79a3394c51ff1b16662f7cbc7e921d2cfef6","ja":"いつもは賑やかなのにシンってしてて、\nなんだか厳かな感じがしますね。","zh":"平时明明挺热闹的，现在却静悄悄的，\n总觉得有种庄严的感觉呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1348.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"3def7ac72094299bdbfbb3ed605d2f774392b622cd2c2635394007ba4445849f","ja":"でも、茜ちゃんは、ここが人でいっぱいに\nなっているほうが好きかなー。","zh":"不过，小茜还是更喜欢这里\n挤满人的样子吧——","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1348.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"826f6b8af4ca9be0fdc3a9053c1c88b158ccba78c7aa9fb37e663bc1085caed5","ja":"それは私も同じです。\nそうできるように、今年も精一杯頑張りましょう。","zh":"我也是一样。\n为了能做到这一点，今年也一起全力以赴吧。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1348.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"cce8aeafca2c48346646ce5692e239ff8533e8fc36267e891f30d281b0ab2eba","ja":"はい！　劇場がいつもいっぱい～♪\nみんなに歌を届けたい～♪","zh":"好！　剧场总是座无虚席～♪\n想把歌声传递给大家～♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1348.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"305d170e40589079b78cad14ce54301a86d942682d73dc9eaae896ad91d7ec62","ja":"ふふふ。では、その思いが伝わるよう、\n新年の挨拶をしておきましょう。","zh":"呵呵呵。那么，为了将这份心意传达出去，\n就来致以新年的问候吧。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1348.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"aa0b1dda5db31a183f347291b19f9520d3ad937ebdb6e98434775b3eef04e5f9","ja":"そうですね！　えっと……、\n昨年はたくさんのいい思い出が作れました。","zh":"是啊！那个……\n去年留下了许多美好的回忆。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1348.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"8001d510c41257ea981792f3debe23aaa96f0e50a317e0636adf554096148352","ja":"今年もたくさん歌ってがんばりますので、\nよろしくお願いします……っと。","zh":"今年我也会多多唱歌、努力加油的，\n还请多多关照……写好啦。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1348.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"3af46e831e8d53809a00a84f8dac6b43e697609bf3005f2a8900207983ac35e6","ja":"では、私も。旧年中は真、大変お世話になりました。\n本年もたゆまぬ努力を……。","zh":"那么，我也来。过去的一年里真承蒙关照了。\n新的一年里也会坚持不懈地努力……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1348.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"d551548b125cd6c3be783057dbfe1fedabf7eb2df54dbc0d41829d60ae10453a","ja":"今年は茜ちゃんの人気がもっとも～っと上がります\nように……よろしくお願いします！","zh":"希望今年小茜的人气能够更～加高涨\n……拜托各位多多支持了！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1348.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"b9f3eee60bd1fd20908e7c28053001cbe4b8345040ddacb2365787ced91f139e","ja":"……よろしくお願いいたします。\nさて、それでは……。","zh":"……请多关照。\n那么，接下来……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1348.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"a07a917d04400e710932b28d565e5152629bf68a965c91745e163f66e87e0f9e","ja":"いよいよお年玉を貰いに行くんだね！　さーて、\n●●●●プロデューサーちゃんはどこにいるのかニャ♪","zh":"终于要去拿压岁钱了呢！好～嘞，\n●●●●小制作人在哪里喵♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
